<div style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</div>

<div style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">Emerging growth company&#160;<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d20258K" format="ixt-sec:boolballotbox" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany" id="ixv-305">&#9744;</ix:nonNumeric></div>

